  :interpretation "Expected. See reference-runtime-gap-2026-07-16.slat. Wave 1 landed ~126 verbs; reference documents 936. Subsequent waves must fill the 810-verb gap. Every documented example is VALID Motoi syntax — the gap is 'not yet in runtime,' not 'no such verb.'"
  :examples-block-on-future-waves 26
  :flag "examples valid but block on future migration waves"
)

