      :question "Do paint-arrow, paint-burst, paint-fireworks, paint-flow, paint-glow, paint-heart, paint-highlight, paint-marquee, paint-point-at, paint-spiral, paint-text belong in Motoi core-forms or in Sakura reference?"
      :impact "13 core-forms' doc-body markdown is Sakura-flavored. If Sakura-owned, move records out. If Motoi, author Motoi-flavored examples."
      :suggested-action "Alfred call on whether paint-* is Motoi framebuffer primitive or Sakura surface primitive.")
  )
  :priority-medium (
    (:item "docbody-vs-examples-format"
      :question "Should the 53 core-forms move from markdown :doc-body to structured :examples ( ... ) like verbs?"
